Built by openprinthq-desktops (apps/bambusuite): Wine on linuxserver.io's Selkies base, restyled for OpenPrintHQ, to run
Bambu Lab's Bambu Suite for Windows. The repository and the image hold no copy of Bambu Suite. The image built contains
the works below, each under its own licence, which the repository and the image keep.

linuxserver.io docker-baseimage-selkies
  https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-baseimage-selkies
  Copyright (C) linuxserver.io. GNU General Public License, version 3 (LICENSE).
  The image's base, its start-up scripts, its window manager settings (defaults/labwc.xml) and its web server
  set-up (etc/s6-overlay/s6-rc.d/init-nginx/run) are linuxserver.io's; common/restyle.py changes the last two
  as described in it. The repository's own files are offered under the same licence, GPL-3.0 (LICENSE).

Selkies
  https://github.com/selkies-project/selkies
  The web desktop and its dashboard (usr/share/selkies), Mozilla Public License 2.0 as published with it.
  The OpenPrintHQ dashboard is a copy of Selkies' own with one stylesheet added; Selkies' files are not changed.


Bambu Suite
  https://bambulab.com/download/suite
  Bambu Lab's software for its laser and cutting modules, under Bambu Lab's own terms. Not in the image or the
  repository: the desktop's first start downloads Bambu Lab's Windows installer from Bambu Lab (the address and
  hash in apps/bambusuite/app.env) and installs it into the desktop's own storage, where the person accepts Bambu
  Lab's terms in its own windows.

Wine
  https://www.winehq.org
  Copyright (C) the Wine project authors. GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later, as published
  with it (opt/wine-stable/share/doc in the image). Installed as WineHQ's Debian packages, at the version in
  apps/bambusuite/upstream.env; its source is WineHQ's for that version. It is not changed.

Firefox ESR
  Debian's firefox-esr package, Mozilla Public License 2.0, used as the desktop's web browser.

Fonts
  Manrope, Sora and JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (the licence files are in the image next to the
  fonts, usr/share/selkies/artisanhub-dashboard/ahi/fonts).
